7:["$","$L12",null,{"initialActivity":{"id":"76","title":"The Svasthya Run 2026","image":"https://runnersduniya.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/The-Svasthya-Run.jpeg","tags":["5"],"priceRange":"699 ","location":"GKVK Campus, Bengaluru","lastUpdated":"3/19/2026","categoryIds":["4"],"categoryNames":[],"description":"🔥 Run for Your Health. Run for a Cause. Run for YOU! 🏃‍♀️🏃‍♂️\n\n🌿✨ The Svasthya Run 2026 is here, and this is not your ordinary run. It is a celebration of movement, wellness, and mindful living!\n\nThis event aims to promote wellness, joy, and a healthier lifestyle through community participation.\n\nDate: 22 March 2026\n\nTime: 6:00 AM\n\nLocation: GKVK Campus, Bengaluru\n\nCategories: 3KM, 5KM, and 10KM\n\nRegistration Fees: 3K – ₹699, 5K – ₹799, 10K – ₹899\n\nOrganizer: I-AIM Healthcare/TDU\n\n💚 Spots are filling fast, do not wait until it’s too late.\n\n💚 Lace up, show up, and be part of a healthier, happier community movement!","date":"Mar 22 , 2026","time":"6:00 AM","mapLink":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/YZmjVqpSbh1LKcw98","contactInfo":"","url":"https://runnersduniya.com/event/the-svasthya-run/"}}]
